From: =?UTF-8?q?Lu=C3=ADs=20Duarte?= <lduarte@cloudflare.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 20:50:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Baseline: span decorations, canvas background, SVG tiling

- A per-line pre-pass reads parley's span-fragment sidecar and paints
  background fills, then borders (top and bottom always, left only if
  is_first_fragment, right only if is_last_fragment), then
  rounded-corner clipping on the outermost fragments.
- Full canvas-background propagation: root and body background-image
  and gradients paint over the whole canvas, not just the root box.
- SVG background-repeat tiling: an explicit per-tile render_svg_tree
  loop with a 4096-tile cap. Raster layers get repeat from the image
  brush's Extend::Repeat.
